    example: `Six decks, dealer hits soft 17, double after split, blackjack pays 3:2: house edge ${e32}%. The same table paying 6:5: ${e65}%. Per 100 hands of one unit each that is ${e32} units against ${e65} units on average, about three times as much.`,
